      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1925 - Abd al-Karim ibn Amr asked Imam (as): \"I have made a vow upon myself to fast until the Qa'im (as) rises.\"\nImam (as) said: \"Do not fast during travel, on the two Eids, on the days of Tashriq, or on the day of doubt.\""
        ]
